13555      data trial; call streaminit(193); do id=1 to 200; age=20+mod(id*7,45); bmi=20+mod(id,12); gender=mod(id,2);
13555    ! drug=rand('bernoulli',1/(1+exp(-(-2+age*.03+gender*.3)))); outcome=rand('bernoulli',1/(1+exp(-(-1+drug*.6+age*.01)))); output; end; run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.TRIAL has 200 observations and 6 variables.

13556      proc causaltrt data=trial method=ipwr; class gender; psmodel drug(ref='0')=age bmi gender; model outcome(ref='0') /dist=bin; run;

